A lightweight plugin that creates a [autoupco_year] shortcode to dynamically display the current year. Perfect for keeping your copyright year updated!

== Description ==

Auto Update Copyright by [Computech Store](https://computechstore.in) is a simple yet powerful plugin designed to dynamically update the copyright year in your WordPress site. With this plugin, you can use the '[autoupco_year]' shortcode anywhere on your site to display the current year automatically.

No more manual updates to your footer or other areas of your site every year—just install, activate, and enjoy hassle-free updates.

**Key Features:**
- Dynamically display the current year with the '[autoupco_year]' shortcode.
- Works seamlessly in posts, pages, widgets, and themes.
- Lightweight and optimized for performance.
- Perfect for footers, copyright notices, and more.

== Installation ==

1. Download the plugin from the WordPress Plugin Directory or upload it manually.
2. Navigate to **Plugins > Add New** in your WordPress admin dashboard.
3. Click **Upload Plugin** and select the ZIP file of this plugin.
4. Click **Install Now**, then activate the plugin.
5. Use the '[autoupco_year]' shortcode in your posts, pages, or widgets.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= How do I use the plugin? =
Simply add the '[autoupco_year]' shortcode wherever you want the current year to be displayed.

Example:
```html
© [autoupco_year] Computech Store. All rights reserved.
